<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod rises 0.6 pct yr/yr in March.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod rises 0.6 pct yr/yr in March.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production rose 0.6 percent year-on-year in March, while month-on-month it fell 0.7 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said on Monday.</p>
<p>				    March 97    February 97    March 96</p>
<p>General Index		   104.4	   105.2	   103.8</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	+0.6	    +0.7</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	-0.7	    +3.2</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	  +1.3	    +1.3</p>
<p>Base Year = 1990</p>
<p>Mining index		    100.3	    89.8	    99.8</p>
<p>Manufacturing industry	104.7	   101.9	   100.6</p>
<p>Electricity, gas		104.0	   122.6	   118.2</p>
<p>--Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
